Modifications relative to the upstream source (all marked with a
"[BATCH]" comment in the corresponding files):

  * applicationId changed to cn.toside.music.mobile.batch so this build
    can coexist with the official app; app name set to "LX Music Batch"
  * batch download queue covering playlist / rank / search / my-list,
    with persistent state and resume
  * download settings: quality tier, filename template, lyrics, cover,
    tags, concurrency, retry count, Wi-Fi-only mode, storage pre-check
  * download page controls: pause all, clear finished, retry failed,
    re-download failed lyrics, diagnostics dump
  * file error logging under download-logs/ with rotation and export
  * performance changes: incremental task notification, ring-cursor
    scheduling, single-pass statistics, throttled persistence,
    FlatList virtualization
  * in-app update check disabled; "About this build" screen added
  * small native modules for network type and app info

The full diff against upstream v1.9.2 is provided in
docs/lx-music-batch.patch.

